  "intro1Title": "Draw a card, see this moment",
  "intro1Body": "The home screen has Card of the Day and Draw. Hold something in mind and choose a spread. Draw quickly, or shuffle, cut, and pick from all 78 cards yourself. Each card comes with its imagery, meaning, a note for you right now, a small step, and a question.",
  "intro2Title": "Learn: get to know each card",
  "intro2Body": "Learn has a library of all 78 cards, beginner courses, and a card quiz that uses spaced repetition to help you remember. Tap the symbols on a card to see what they’re saying.",
  "intro3Title": "Tarot Journal: save, then look back",
  "intro3Body": "Save your question, the cards you drew, and what you noticed first. Set a reminder to look back later at what you thought then and how things unfolded. You can back up your journal to a file and restore it on a new phone.",
