  "intro4Body": "From a reading, you can breathe with the soundscape of the card’s element: in for 4 seconds, out for 6. Fire is a campfire, Water a flowing stream, Air wind in the trees, Earth mountain stillness. With headphones, you can turn on a 7.83 Hz binaural beat.",
  "intro5Title": "Sharing, Premium, and your thoughts",
